  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Food Security and Safety in Indonesia through reducing Food loss and Waste in small-scale Fisheries and rice productions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This seminar will foster national dialogue on minimizing food loss and waste (FLW) with a focus on the small-scale fisheries sector and small-scale famers in rice production in Indonesia. It will raise awareness of the magnitude of FLW in fisheries and rice production, its impact on food security, and the economic losses incurred. The seminar will also highlight the importance of investing in appropriate technologies and infrastructure. The seminar will also set an example for how a country as a member of ASEAN can inspire to implement some of the aspiration ASEAN works with.</narrative>
  </description>
